<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>Suhail Khan alias Sohail Khan v. State NCT of Delhi, BAIL APPLN. 2282/2026 &amp; CRL.M.(BAIL) 1793/2026</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Court</th><td>High Court of Delhi, Justice Mini Pushkarna</td></tr>
